$ pace client add acme --currency EUR --rate 95   # at 09:00
success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Added the client `acme` (acme) in EUR at 95.00 an hour from 2026-11-26.
pace took these defaults: name `acme` from the key, the rate from today (2026-11-26) and no rounding; `pace client edit acme` changes them.

----- stderr -----

